[{"id":"playwright-roadmap-optional","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["学习路线","进阶"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright文档(一)学习路线.md","articleTitle":"Playwright文档(一) 学习路线","articlePath":"posts/5ce76fb/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright文档(一)学习路线.md","articleTitle":"Playwright文档(一) 学习路线","articlePath":"posts/5ce76fb/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>完成常规 Web 自动化主线后，哪一篇可以按项目需要选学？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>B\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>无障碍、视觉回归、WebSocket、GraphQL 和 BDD 属于按需扩展；定位和框架设计是主线基础。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["B"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>页面元素定位\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>进阶内容\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>测试框架设计\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"demo-http-503","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"HTTP 基础","tags":["状态码","服务端错误"],"articleKey":"flashcard-reference-demo/index.md","articleTitle":"闪卡跨文章引用预览","articlePath":"flashcard-reference-demo/index.html","articles":[{"articleKey":"flashcard-reference-demo/index.md","articleTitle":"闪卡跨文章引用预览","articlePath":"flashcard-reference-demo/index.html"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>HTTP 状态码 \u003cstrong>503\u003c/strong> 表示什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>服务器暂时无法处理请求。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>503 Service Unavailable\u003c/code> 表示服务器当前无法处理请求，常见原因包括临时过载或维护。服务端可以通过 \u003ccode>Retry-After\u003c/code> 响应头提示客户端稍后重试。\u003c/p>\n\u003ch3 id=\"参考资料\">\u003ca href=\"#参考资料\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"参考资料\">\u003c/a>参考资料\u003c/h3>\u003cul>\n\u003cli>\u003ca href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Status/503\">MDN：503 Service Unavailable\u003c/a>\u003c/li>\n\u003c/ul>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]